      <description>&lt;p&gt;The enhanced input system relies on two kinds of files in your editor:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Input action data asset&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Input mapping context data asset&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;input action&lt;/strong&gt; data asset (e.g., &amp;ldquo;IA_Jump&amp;rdquo;) is how you bind an &lt;strong&gt;input&lt;/strong&gt; to an &lt;strong&gt;action&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>What goes where?</title>
      <link>/unreal/what-to-put-where/</link>
